Implements `plans/03-volcanoes/01-volcano-sites.md` for NeoForge 1.21.1.

### Scope
- deterministic sparse volcano candidates and stable site IDs;
- persistent `VolcanoSavedData` with spacing/idempotency guarantees;
- tectonic mapping for `STRATOVOLCANO`, `SHIELD`, `FISSURE`, and `CALDERA`;
- bounded additive physical terrain shaping during normal new-chunk worldgen;
- registered `volcanoes:volcano_sites` feature/configured/placed feature and biome modifier;
- deferred server-side persistence only for `isNewChunk=true` Overworld chunks;
- existing chunks, Nether, and End remain untouched;
- optional TFC/Terralith/Volcanoes volcanic terrain hints affect only local shaping and never site existence or UUID.

### Safety / compatibility
- does not replace the Overworld generator;
- worldgen resolution is stateless and does not access `SavedData` on the generation thread;
- no neighbor chunk loading/scanning and no retroactive terrain carving;
- Terralith, Tectonic, BWG, and TFC remain optional providers/hints rather than hard site-identity dependencies.

